OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Purcell
OL,6,     F5/5. Donald explores the theories
OL,7,     Faround Purcell's death at the age
OL,8,     Fof just 36, and examines the
OL,9,     Fvarious tributes made to the
OL,10,     Fcomposer after his passing.
OL,11,G1700 In Tune
OL,12,     FKatie Derham with live music from
OL,13,     Fpianist Ariel Lanyi, ahead of his
OL,14,     Fperformance at Lichfield Festival.
OL,15,     FActor Helen George sings live and
OL,16,     Ftalks about starring in High
OL,17,     FSociety.
